## Quick start

```bash
# Open Magistr and choose or prepare a project
magistr-desktop

# Run the configured project checks
magistr validate
```

The desktop opens conversations and reviews project setup before applying it.
The CLI runs headless sessions, project administration and checks.

## Configuration

`.magistr/project.json` holds the check commands and plan policy. An empty
command means that check is not configured: report it as missing, never as a
pass. Project conventions are in `.claude/rules/conventions.md`.
